# Only what the image builds from: the server, its web client and the shared libraries, never build output,
# secrets or tests. A smaller context also uploads faster and changes less often, so layers are reused.

# Build output and tool state
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/node_modules
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user

# Not part of the server
.git
.github
agent
tests
plan.md
**/*.md

# Secrets that might sit in a working copy
**/.env
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/secrets*.json

# The image files themselves
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
